  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758922,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "### 10 Great Games II - Basil the Great Mouse Detective (Commodore 64)\n\nEmbark on a thrilling adventure with Basil, a brilliant but eccentric mouse detective, in this charming and challenging Commodore 64 classic!  Based on the beloved Disney animated film, *The Great Mouse Detective*, you must unravel a sinister plot to overthrow Queen Mildred.  Aided by his loyal companion, Dr. Dawson, Basil investigates a series of kidnappings and uncovers a conspiracy led by the nefarious Professor Ratigan.\n\nGameplay involves navigating detailed environments, collecting clues, and solving puzzles to progress.  Expect tense stealth sequences, tricky platforming, and engaging dialogue with a cast of memorable characters.  The game features impressive graphics and a catchy soundtrack that perfectly capture the film's atmosphere.  Prepare for a captivating mystery filled with danger, wit, and a healthy dose of Victorian charm.  Can you expose Ratigan's scheme and save Queen Mildred before it's too late?"
    },
